## Agent contract — keep Linear updated

When you **start**, **finish**, or **open a PR** on a tracked task:

1. Find issue — `import-log.json` task ID → `SAN-*`, or Linear MCP `list_issues` with `project: MDEAPP` + title prefix (`SCREEN-021`, `F47`, etc.)
2. Update state via Linear MCP `save_issue`:
   - Start coding → **In Progress**
   - PR opened → **In Review** (+ link PR in `links`)
   - `task-verifier` + evidence pass → **In Review** (+ comment with evidence path) — **never Done unless user explicitly approves**
3. **Todo reorder** — after status changes, ensure next unblocked P0 item is **top of Todo** (manual drag in UI, or note in comment if MCP cannot set sort)
4. **In Review** — keep ~10 implementation tasks visible near top, ordered by implementation order (not PR date)

When flipping `tasks/**` frontmatter `status: Done` → update Linear to **In Review** pending user approval (or tell user which SAN-* to approve).

## Cursor Cloud Agent delegation

Per [Cursor Linear integration](https://cursor.com/docs/integrations/linear):

- Assign issue to **Cursor**, or comment `@Cursor …`
- Always include repo: `@Cursor implement … [repo=amo-tech-ai/mdeapp]`
- Optional: `[branch=feature-name]` · `[model=…]`
- Label group **`repo`** → child `amo-tech-ai/mdeapp` on issues/projects (see Cursor docs § Repository labels)

Cloud Agent PR → move issue to **In Review**; user approves → **Done**.

## MCP checklist

| Action | Tool |
|--------|------|
| List / find issues | `list_issues` — `project: MDEAPP`, `state`, `label` |
| Update status / links | `save_issue` — `state`, `links`, `description` |
| **Weekly changelog** | `save_status_update` — `type: initiative`, `initiative: Phase 1 — mdeai MVP launch` — template [`tasks/linear/templates/initiative-update.md`](../../../tasks/linear/templates/initiative-update.md) |
| Team statuses | `list_issue_statuses` — team `Sanjiovani` |
| Bulk import / deps | `node scripts/linear-import-tasks.mjs` then `linear-organize-project.mjs` |
| **Todo manual sort** | `node scripts/linear-sort-todo.mjs` — all Todo issues by milestone + impl order |

`LINEAR_API_KEY` in repo root `.env.local` (never commit).

