## Anti-patterns

- ❌ Agent or import script sets **Done** without user approval
- ❌ Todo sorted by `updatedAt` or created date
- ❌ Linear Done while `tasks/**` still `Not Started` / no evidence
- ❌ Starting Deferred milestone work while P0 open
- ❌ >3 issues In Progress without user approval
- ❌ New issue without `track:*` label + milestone

